classDiagram
direction TB
%% Source — the render input (RenderSpec) + fetching the specific story

class AudioMode {
  <<enum>>
  VOICE
}
note for AudioMode "VOICE = TTS narration (song mode is out of v1)"

class RenderSpec {
  +channel : str
  +niche : str
  +source_ref : str
  +kind : RenderKind
  +visual_palette : tuple~VisualKind~
  +aspect_ratio : str
  +output_resolution : tuple~int~
  +output_fps : int
  +duration_target_s : int
  +duration_max_s : int
  +audio_mode : AudioMode
  +voice_provider : str
  +voice_id : str
  +caption_style : CaptionStyle
  +lower_thirds : bool
  +chapter_cards : bool
  +closer_panel : bool
  +watermark : Watermark
  +video_grade : str
  +music_policy : MusicPolicy
  +music_bed : str
  +tone : str
  +critic_loop : bool
  +extra : dict
}
note for RenderSpec "the immutable render request = the HLD 'Specs' box · built once, arrives on ctx.spec:<br/>channel = which channel · niche = which lane/adapter (reddit_aita, wikipedia, ...) · source_ref = the SPECIFIC story (a URL, or a topic/query; empty = adapter discovers the top item)<br/>kind = short/long · visual_palette = allowed VisualKinds (user picks) · aspect_ratio / output_resolution / output_fps = output shape · duration_target_s / duration_max_s = length<br/>audio_mode / voice_provider / voice_id = narration voice · caption_style = caption knobs · lower_thirds / chapter_cards / closer_panel = overlay toggles<br/>watermark / video_grade = post-production · music_policy / music_bed = music · tone = tts tone override · critic_loop = re-critique on/off · extra = free channel knobs<br/>(field TYPES RenderKind / VisualKind / CaptionStyle / Watermark / MusicPolicy are detailed in their own diagrams)"

class SourceStage {
  <<stage>>
  +run(ctx)
}
note for SourceStage "the FIRST render stage · reads spec.niche + spec.source_ref via ctx.spec<br/>→ calls SourceRouter → writes SOURCE."

class SourceRouter {
  <<service · det>>
  +fetch(niche, source_ref) SourceDoc
}
note for SourceRouter "niche picks the adapter (reddit / wikipedia / youtube / x / text);<br/>source_ref = the exact URL to fetch, OR a query to discover, OR empty = grab the top item for the niche."

class SourceDoc {
  +slug : str
  +title : str
  +body : str
  +source : str
  +url : str
  +backend : str
  +metadata : dict
}
note for SourceDoc "the raw mined story BEFORE rewriting<br/>slug = stable id/filename · title = headline · body = full raw text (ScriptStage condenses + enriches it)<br/>source = origin tag e.g. reddit:AITA · url = the resolved link · backend = which adapter served it · metadata = adapter extras"

RenderSpec ..> AudioMode
RenderSpec ..> SourceStage : ctx.spec
SourceStage ..> SourceRouter : calls
SourceRouter ..> SourceDoc : produces

